818191809", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827973_2556045824858475_4896237383260856213_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AzdaVw_pREQQ7kNvwGysDP8&_nc_oc=Adq6zfnIPOoUyrfI4RGxWh8QBEfEHtRoMty2H1ldWmR85MNBJ6CrOUR5XHoL7tg9Nls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQSnWGr4QfTa7MJlT4cA0RX7sJzE0iqZDfnMhDtP2w5kg&oe=6AFC7A69"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x 1440x.png", "id": "1591260649405949", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1591260659405948_2853236553968467609_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dv_z2YuNGVQQ7kNvwFd2dvk&_nc_oc=AdrwLdeA-M3l76XENkaEf5TjqnQ5Zonpr7POEirFuvbZmbMn7g_kawKxyggRv6oTTNE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSuLZSyBdjpIc1bixjoPedv_Bu7orNRQl92pFPvSh5hqA&oe=6AFC7372"}, "display_name": "Vice Miami: Night Club Update", "keywords": ["NighClub", "OpenWorld", "Shooting", "RealPhysics"], "long_description": "VICE MIAMI: MULTIPLAYER UPDATE\n\nThe city is open, it\u2019s free to play, and now you can explore it with friends. Vice Miami is an open-world VR sandbox where you make the rules.\n\nMULTIPLAYER IS HERE\nTeam up with friends and take over the city. Cruise the strip, hit the Night Club as a crew, or settle things with your fists. Live now!\n\nBE WHO YOU WANT TO BE\nCreate a male or female character and customize every detail: eye color, lip color, height, body type, outfits and more.\n\nREAL PHYSICS, REAL CHAOS\nGrab any character with full physics. Drag them, throw them, or fight it out. Every hit and fall reacts to your movement.\n\nGUNS AND PREMIUM CARS\nGear up with weapons and drive premium cars. Cruise at sunset or tear through the streets at night.\n\nNEW IN THIS UPDATE\n\nMultiplayer: explore and cause chaos with friends\nNight Club: hit the dance floor\nGarage: store and show off your rides\nGun Store: pick up new weapons\n\nCOMING SOON\n\nGas Station and Mart: work as an employee\nNew places and features over time\n\nBuilt with our players. Tell us what you want next in the reviews. Planned features may change before release.\n\nDownload free, bring your friends, and own the night.", "short_description": "Welcome to Vice Miami: Night Club Update a free open-world VR sandbox where you make the rules. Create your own male or female character, then grab anyone with realistic physics: drag them, toss them, or land a punch. Arm yourself with an arsenal of guns, cruise in premium cars, and explore the brand-new Night Club, Garage and Gun Store. Multiplayer is coming soon, with jobs, new locations and more on the way. Your city keeps growing with every update. Jump in free and own the night!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ascendrixstudio.github.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix S", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ascendrixstudio.github.io/privacy-policy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1373152895884695"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1078311228135514_8420444694159383882_n.png?st