a7MJlT4cA0RX7sJzE0iqZDfnMhDtP2w5kg&oe=6AFC7A69"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x 1440x.png", "id": "1591260649405949", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1591260659405948_2853236553968467609_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dv_z2YuNGVQQ7kNvwFd2dvk&_nc_oc=AdrwLdeA-M3l76XENkaEf5TjqnQ5Zonpr7POEirFuvbZmbMn7g_kawKxyggRv6oTTNE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSuLZSyBdjpIc1bixjoPedv_Bu7orNRQl92pFPvSh5hqA&oe=6AFC7372"}, "display_name": "Vice Miami: Night Club Update", "keywords": ["NighClub", "OpenWorld", "Shooting", "RealPhysics"], "long_description": "VICE MIAMI: NIGHT CLUB UPDATE\n\nThe city is open, and it's free to play. Vice Miami is an open-world VR sandbox where you make the rules, from the beach roads to the back alleys.\n\nBE WHO YOU WANT TO BE\nCreate your own male or female character and customize every detail: eye color, lip color, height, body type, outfits and much more. Make them look exactly how you want before you hit the streets.\n\nREAL PHYSICS, REAL CHAOS\nGrab any character in the city with full physics. Drag them, throw them, or settle things with your fists. Every hit and every fall reacts naturally to your movement.\n\nGUNS AND PREMIUM CARS\nGear up with a range of weapons and take the wheel of premium cars. Cruise the strip at sunset or tear through the streets at night.\n\nNEW IN THIS UPDATE\n\nNight Club: hit the dance floor and enjoy the night\nGarage: store and show off your rides\nGun Store: browse and pick up new weapons\n\nCOMING SOON\n\nMultiplayer: explore and cause chaos with friends\nGas Station and Mart: take a job and work as an employee\nNew places and features added to your city over time\n\nA CITY THAT KEEPS GROWING\nVice Miami: Night Club Update is built with our players. Every update brings new things to do, new places to explore and new ways to play. Tell us what you want to see next in the reviews.\n\nPlanned features are in development and may change before release.\n\nDownload free and own the night.", "short_description": "Welcome to Vice Miami: Night Club Update a free open-world VR sandbox where you make the rules. Create your own male or female character, then grab anyone with realistic physics: drag them, toss them, or land a punch. Arm yourself with an arsenal of guns, cruise in premium cars, and explore the brand-new Night Club, Garage and Gun Store. Multiplayer is coming soon, with jobs, new locations and more on the way. Your city keeps growing with every update. Jump in free and own the night!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ascendrixstudio.github.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix S", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ascendrixstudio.github.io/privacy-policy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1314396115093707"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2150440462489380"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2150440462489380"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1791561900, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2150440462489380"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": 